Eduka-Pastel is the Orchis GTK theme (https://github.com/vinceliuice/Orchis-theme)
by vinceliuice with Edukasaun colors, built with Orchis' install.sh (sassc)
after changing src/_sass/_color-palette-default.scss, 14 px corners.

Since Edukasaun Desktop 0.11 Pre-Stable it follows the blue of the Edukasaun OS
logo (#1E88E5): a calmer blue accent (#3B87D4, #2C72BA under white text) and
only a faint blue tint on the surfaces. The mint green of older versions was
recolored with tools/recolor-pastel.py (GTK 2, 3 and 4). The xfwm4 and
openbox-3 window borders are generated by tools/gen-wm-themes.py with the same
colors. Licensed under the GNU GPL version 3 (see COPYING).
